          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "recto, right margin",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>...the house without the stairway, for the |stairway is my property and my possession&rdquo;. He started telling |anyone who came to inspect it (i.e. the house): &ldquo;Buy the [house without]&nbsp;</li>\n<li>the stairway&rdquo;. The matter is ruining her. He (i.e. the servant, the writer of the letter) |wants by (writing) this (letter) to put an end to (the brother-in-law&rsquo;s demanding) a bribe and ransom from her and her |hunger (?) [...]</li></ol>\n",
